# One source tree

This repo was flattened. There is **no** `sassy-talk-clean/` directory and **no** parallel stub copies of the apps.

## Canonical paths (repo root = `sassy-talks/`)

- Android app: `android-app/`
- Android Rust/JNI: `android-native/`
- iOS: `ios-native/`
- Desktop: `tauri-desktop/`
- Shared Rust core: `core/`
- Relay worker: `cloudflare-worker/`

## Never do this

- Do not create `sassy-talk-clean/` or copy projects under a nested “clean” folder
- Do not create a second `android-app/`, `tauri-desktop/`, or `cloudflare-worker/` elsewhere in the repo
- Do not “sync” fixes between two trees — there is only one tree

Dual trees caused agents to patch incomplete stubs while the real app diverged, producing fix/regression loops.
